# Analogue-derived candidate for the supplied Mn-W-O powder pattern.
# Parent: COD 9008146, BiMn2O5 (Pbam; Niizeki & Wachi, 1968).
# Transformation: Bi -> W; parent topology/fractional coordinates retained;
# cell axes replaced by the independently indexed residual cell in the
# conventional Pbam setting (a,b,c = indexed c,b,a). This axis assignment
# is selected by the residual reflection intensities, not metric proximity.
